    "blogtextliquid_LBJgtB": {
      "type": "blogtextliquid",
      "custom_css": [],
      "name": "Blog Text Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "text_content": "<p>Walk through any department store fragrance hall right now and you will notice an unmistakable shift: sweetness is everywhere. But this is not the cloying, cotton-candy sugar rush of early-2000s body sprays that gave everyone in the room a headache.</p><p>Sweetness has undergone an intellectual renaissance in modern perfumery. Today's gourmand fragrances are complex, dark, smoky, and deeply unisex, balancing edible indulgence with sophisticated woods and bitter aromatics.</p>"
      }
    },
